<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Fury Warrior DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Dragon Soul, Firelands, Twilight Protocol Dungeons, and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c1">Best in Slot Gear for Fury Warrior DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>
<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit Rating - You will want a total of 8% chance to hit, equating to 961 hit rating.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Expertise Rating - Expertise reduces the chance to be dodged or parried - a crucial stat to avoid important abilities such as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86346/colossus-smash">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_colossussmash.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Colossus Smash</span></a> missing.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Strength - As our primary stat, we will seek to obtain Strength wherever possible, in slots such as gems and enchants</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Critical Strike - Our most desired Secondary stat.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit beyond Soft Cap - Our second most desired Secondary stat. Hit lowers on our priority list post Soft Cap, but continues to have value due to our <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=13046/enrage">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unholyfrenzy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enrage</span></a> talent.</div></li></ol>
